 * Parses the configuration document into a tree of nodes rooted at a
 * `table` node. Each node is `{ kind, ... }` where `kind` is one of
 * `table`, `aot` (array of tables), `array`, `string`, `integer`, `float`
 * or `boolean`. Table nodes carry a `data` object keyed by decoded name;
 * `aot` and `array` nodes carry an `items` list.
